    "closure": "proof plus exact official integer certificate",
    "statement": "Every bounded-tail degree-two complement has the form K_u=IA_u+chi(u)g_u(u^2M_0-2uM_1+M_2), with deg A_u,deg g_u<=t. Its root subsets annul explicit 2(t+1)-square Pade determinants of degree at most 2(t+1). Official incidence counting forces more than 9999/10000 of the relevant antipodal 14-circuits or 991/1000 of the reciprocal 18-circuits to be identically singular; classifying those zero circuits is the remaining degree-two leaf.",
